        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potato grading
Refers to 1 kg of ungraded potatoes ;
UUID: c96f23a6-cb59-3bd3-8795-b3461fe074d2
Demand on machinery, buildings (shed) and electricity for potato grading and weighting.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Uses a potato grader and a weigh.
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data based on the yearly published catalog of machine costs in Switzerland (FAT) and on information from machinery experts of the FAT. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c96f23a6-cb59-3bd3-8795-b3461fe074d2.xml</text>
